Files under libpdw/src/upstream_*.cpp, libpdw/src/flex.cpp, libpdw/src/pocsag.cpp
and libpdw/include/headers/ are generated from or derived from upstream PDW source
by tools/import_upstream.sh (pinned to upstream commit 6e18d3c) and keep their
original copyright. Everything else (compat/, support.cpp, cli/, tests/) is new.

Not imported on purpose: upstream's helper_funcs.cpp/.h, which carry the notice
"Do not modify, reproduce or use this file without my permission!" and so cannot be
redistributed under the GPL. Their few utility functions are re-implemented in
libpdw/src/support.cpp. Upstream's utils/ (AT&T/Lucent OSTYPE, binary.cpp) are
likewise not used.
